#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:5 bd22000b94454be5b2560496e83e53d4
msgid "Follow Mode"
msgstr "Follow 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:10 2ceb83db42e34524ab25fe61550b1368
msgid ""
"When switched into Follow, the vehicle will attempt to follow another "
"vehicle (or anything publishing its position) at a specified offset.  The"
" lead vehicle's position must be published to the vehicle in Follow mode "
"using a telemetry system as shown below. QGroundControl's application "
"(QGC) for Android phones and computers has this feature in beta testing "
"also, so instead of following a vehicle, it will follow the ground "
"control station, similar to FOLLOW ME mode in Copter."
msgstr ""
"切换到 Follow 模式后，车辆将尝试以指定偏移量跟随另一辆车辆（或任何发布其位置的对象）。领头车辆的位置必须通过如下所示的数传系统发布给处于 "
"Follow 模式的车辆。Android 手机和电脑版 "
"QGroundControl（QGC）应用程序也有此功能的测试版，因此不是跟随车辆，而是跟随地面控制站，类似于 Copter 中的 FOLLOW "
"ME 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:12 0a06561b93ba450aacd8014e173a9b6d
msgid ""
"In its simplest form, each vehicle has a telemetry radio with the same "
"NETID, on one of their telemetry ports."
msgstr "最简单的形式是：每辆车在其中一个数传端口上安装具有相同 NETID 的数传无线电。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:17 399f89c9da4541b48687e612178b56c8
msgid ""
"Vehicle A merely enters FOLLOW mode and it will attempt to follow Vehicle"
" B, and vice-versa."
msgstr "车辆 A 只需进入 Follow 模式，即可尝试跟随车辆 B，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:19 9ad08c26cfe74686b96afa118114c9c3
msgid ""
"If Vehicle A or B requires Ground Station Control, an additional "
"Telemetry radio on a different NETID (YY) can be installed on another "
"telemetry port on the vehicle controller, paired with the GCS's radio on "
"that same NETID."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆 A 或 B 需要地面站控制，可以在车辆控制器的另一个数传端口上安装使用不同 NETID（YY）的额外数传无线电，与地面站上相同 "
"NETID 的无线电配对。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:24 a75e295d484f4d46bb24bfb9a4dc921b
msgid ""
"If using QGroundControl ensure the Application setting under the General "
"tab ``Stream GCS Position`` is set to \"When in Follow Me Flight Mode\" "
"or \"Always\".  Next connect to the vehicle and switch to FOLLOW Mode and"
" it will then follow the computer/phone running QGC."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 QGroundControl，请确保常规选项卡下的应用程序设置中 ``Stream GCS Position`` 设置为「在 "
"Follow Me 飞行模式时」或「始终」。然后连接到车辆并切换到 Follow 模式，它将跟随运行 QGC 的电脑/手机。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:29 320a8125d90a46a4a58649a1058d6bca
msgid "The following parameters can be used to tune Follow mode's performance:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整 Follow 模式的性能："

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:31 4603f796d51547ceaa398f2af524bc94
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`: set to 1 to enable follow mode and "
"refresh parameters."
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`：设置为 1 以启用 Follow 模式并刷新参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:32 e6e270eb492f4d53b6c60a4eb6e167a5
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`: MAVLink system id of lead vehicle (\"0\" "
"means follow the first vehicle \"seen\")."
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`：领头车辆的 MAVLink 系统 ID（「0」表示跟随第一个「发现」的车辆）。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:33 d59053dfbd404394868e5967faa78582
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`: if lead vehicle is more than this "
"many meters away, give up on following and hold position (loiter if boat,"
" stop if ground vehicle)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`：如果领头车辆距离超过此值（米），则放弃跟随并保持位置（若为船则 "
"Loiter，若为地面车辆则停止）。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:34 36cdd71772864cb0aead7b14e425788c
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`, :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y <FOLL_OFS_Y>`, "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>` (not used in Rover) : 3D offset (in "
"meters) from the lead vehicle. If they are zero, then the current "
"vehicle's offset from the follow target at time of mode entry is used "
"every time. These offsets can be altered via Mavlink and will take effect"
" immediately. However, if they were originally zero and changed during "
"FOLLOW MODE rather than during another mode, they will be reset to zero "
"for the next entry into FOLLOW mode, until a reboot occurs and then the "
"changed offsets will be restored."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y "
"<FOLL_OFS_Y>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>` （Rover "
"中不使用）：相对领头车辆的三维偏移量（米）。如果为零，则每次使用进入模式时当前车辆与跟随目标的偏移量。这些偏移量可通过 MAVLink "
"更改，并立即生效。但是，如果它们原来为零并在 Follow 模式中（而非其他模式中）被更改，则下次进入 Follow "
"模式时将重置为零，直到重启后更改的偏移量才会恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:35 9b8bf865f6904498a56d4b2318ad107f
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`: set to 0 if offsets are North-East "
"(NED), 1 if offsets are relative to lead vehicle's heading, see diagrams "
"below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`：若偏移量为北东坐标系（NED）则设为 "
"0，若偏移量相对于领头车辆航向则设为 1，详见下图。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:36 67d4ee7c6c474cda92d864024df3f19c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`: gain which controls how aggressively this"
" vehicle moves towards lead vehicle (limited by :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`：控制此飞行器向目标飞行器移动积极程度的增益（受 :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED "
"<WPNAV_SPEED>` 限制）"

